The test independently parsed the generated GLB payloads and verified both LODs: ordered bark/foliage materials; four embedded Atlas PNGs matching the template and each other; eight dense FLOAT attributes on each primitive; finite/unit normals; valid unit tangents, indices, and per-primitive Uint16 limits; Khronos validation; measured triangle budgets; exact retained-vertex attributes and leaf pivots; 1.2m by 1.2m foliage cards (1.44m2 each); foliage atlas tile bounds/orientation; and independently recomputed bark UVs. It also checked repeat-byte determinism, unchanged inputs, manifest/reference hashes, and overwrite/outside-root rejection.

