Measured triangles: LOD0 13,806; LOD1 4,866. Bounds: LOD0 15.964m tall; LOD1 15.870m tall; both roots at y=0. Tangent cancellation fallback counts: LOD0 0; LOD1 1.

Tangent handedness test correction: an initial broad test compared each smoothed/averaged Mikk tangent against every incident triangle's UV-gradient bitangent. It failed on an ordinary simplified LOD1 corner (223, dot +0.9703), which was not a valid per-triangle contract for averaged tangents. The final test instead re-runs installed raw Mikk on the exported indexed triangle stream: ordinary output xyz matches raw Mikk and output w is exactly its single glTF conversion (negative raw w). At raw-Mikk cancellation corners, the test independently derives the UV-gradient fallback sign and checks the converted exported w. This passes on both LODs; it does not infer every averaged tangent from one face's gradient.

